{
  "about": "Where one of a login's addresses fills, by the match the owner set on it (Bitwarden's: null none, 0 base domain, 1 host, 2 starts with, 3 exact, 4 regular expression, 5 never), for each caller: agent is an agent's fill in its browser or on the owner's Mac (server/agent/browser/vault.go fillsOn: with no match set, the exact host and its www twin), extension the owner's own click in the Chrome extension (clients/chrome-extension/src/vault.rs fills_on: with no match set, any https host of the address's registrable domain, as Bitwarden's default). The Mac app (core/src/macvault.rs) takes origin and allowed as the agents' browser answers them. Where either fills, origin is the page's own origin, where the fill may land, and allowed its registrable domain. A page's address needs its scheme; a saved one without is https's.",
